7. Quick Start Commands

1. Validate all URLs, columns, and recipes before deployment:sh
/bin/sh "${BUILD_HOME}/installscripts/VerifyManifest.sh"
Use code with caution.
2. Execute on each machine role during bootstrap:sh
/bin/sh "${BUILD_HOME}/installscripts/InstallEngine.sh" build   # Build Machine
/bin/sh "${BUILD_HOME}/installscripts/InstallEngine.sh" web     # Webserver
/bin/sh "${BUILD_HOME}/installscripts/InstallEngine.sh" auto    # Autoscaler
/bin/sh "${BUILD_HOME}/installscripts/InstallEngine.sh" db      # Database
Use code with caution.
3. Preview and prune stale cached artifacts after version upgrades:sh
/bin/sh "${BUILD_HOME}/installscripts/PruneArtifactCache.sh" --dry-run
/bin/sh "${BUILD_HOME}/installscripts/PruneArtifactCache.sh"
Use code with caution.
If you'd like any final additions, I can:
• Provide a one-command setup script that writes all of these files and symlinks (goofys.sh, geesefs.sh) onto disk in /home/development
• Add nala fetch --auto to InstallEngine.sh for automatic mirror benchmarking
